{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballad</strong> is a\u00a0musical 3D adventure  game ! <br><br>Embark on this cosy journey where you\u00a0will play as Key, a Kalimba player bard and this instrument will be your only tool in order to progress in this game. <br>As a bard, you resolve all dangers by the magic of music, so you don't need HP, or game over, you are free to enjoy your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you will have to understand the world around you and echoes its melodies, sometime you will have to use the songs you've learnt in order to explore deeper.<br>Anyway you will always be free to jam or enjoy playing your instrument under a coconut tree and chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will be able to call, interact, sooth the people of the island and much more thanks to your musical instrument, try to know a bit more about the different biomes villagers and their musical lifestyle.<br><br><i>The game is designed to be played with a controller but the keyboard is also supported.</i><br> <br><i>More details coming soon</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528200?t=1765833138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528200?t=1765833138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/14bb2df928bde314fe310163185bc6b9e105293a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765833138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/14bb2df928bde314fe310163185bc6b9e105293a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765833138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3883540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballad</strong> is a\u00a0musical 3D adventure  game ! <br><br>Embark on this cosy journey where you\u00a0will play as Key, a Kalimba player bard and this instrument will be your only tool in order to progress in this game. <br>As a bard, you resolve all dangers by the magic of music, so you don't need HP, or game over, you are free to enjoy your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you will have to understand the world around you and echoes its melodies, sometime you will have to use the songs you've learnt in order to explore deeper.<br>Anyway you will always be free to jam or enjoy playing your instrument under a coconut tree and chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will be able to call, interact, sooth the people of the island and much more thanks to your musical instrument, try to know a bit more about the different biomes villagers and their musical lifestyle.<br><br><i>The game is designed to be played with a controller but the keyboard is also supported.</i><br> <br><i>More details coming soon</i></p>","developers":["50 Rats Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/b4754e71105d14463928514370f61cf8a66f5866/header.jpg?t=1765833138","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Sonoma (14)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Mac Intel &amp; Mac Silicon supported<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3528200/1620179253/ba2b3c0642baff43df3ecc45a3f4a8859d7da9db/1751495326/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755518659","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3528200/1620179253/ba2b3c0642baff43df3ecc45a3f4a8859d7da9db/1751495326/dash_h26